oc-h2" href="#zh-beats-47-55">第47–55段</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-beats-56-62">第56–62段</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-beats-63-76">第63–76段</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-beats-77-85">第77–85段</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-beats-86-99">第86–99段</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-preparation">付款、招募与人员是否在场</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-td">塔防前置条件</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-late-prerequisites">后期前置清单</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-beat-100">第100段</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-recovery">出发前先恢复资源</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-after-100">第100段之后</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-troubleshooting">到场后没有触发</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-related">相关指南</a></div></div></aside>
<article class="wiki-article"><p class="starter-reading-note" data-copy-en="Select a screenshot to enlarge it. Screens show example inventories and progress." data-copy-zh="点击截图可放大查看。图中的库存和进度仅为示例，请以自己的实际情况为准。">Select a screenshot to enlarge it. Screens show example inventories and progress.</p><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-en" data-lang-panel="en" lang="en"><div class="starter-lead"><p>Check <strong>Objectives, Communications and the current action menu first</strong>. This is a navigation guide for the complete released <strong>v1.0 Beta x main story, Beats 1–100</strong>. Open only your current range: the tables reveal destinations and prerequisites, while leaving identities, character fates and scene outcomes to the game.</p></div>
<section id="en-follow"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="How_to_Follow_the_Story"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Reading_Time_Windows"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Major_Gates_to_Prepare_For"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Beats_1_to_10_—_Present_Era"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Late-Route_Recruitment_and_Availability"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Combat_Preparation_Without_Story_Outcomes"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Alignment_and_Scene_Choices"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Time_Costs_and_Recovery"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Troubleshooting"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="The_Next_Beat_Does_Not_Trigger"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Common_Stops"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Accuracy_and_Related_Guides"></span><h2>Find your next step</h2><p>Every numbered beat follows the previous one. Unless a row adds a requirement, you need the preceding beat completed, access to the exact room, and the listed arrival time. A building exterior, district map or adjacent room is not the same destination. Finish every remaining dialogue and choice, then leave and re-enter when checking another automatic scene.</p><p><strong>Beats 8 and 11 are manual actions.</strong> At the Dojo choose <strong>Ask Lilu to Train You</strong>; at the Research Lab choose <strong>Discuss the Research Findings</strong>. Entering the room alone does not start them. Personal-story H2Hs are also selected from the relevant portrait; an automatic scene with a similar title does not complete a separate H2H.</p><p>Hours use the in-game clock and include the start, exclude the end: 09:00–17:00 means 09:00–16:59. Split overnight windows include both listed parts. “Any” removes only the story’s hour gate; location access and opening hours still apply. The Library normally opens 08:00–22:00.</p><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 900px"><a aria-label="View full screenshot: The current numbered objective gives the next requirement. This early example asks for an Acquaintance relationship with Sonia." href="../assets/images/wiki/story-guide/en-current-objective-full.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="The current numbered objective gives the next requirement. This early example asks for an Acquaintance relationship with Sonia." decoding="async" height="102" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/story-guide/en-current-objective.webp" width="702"/></a><figcaption>The current numbered objective gives the next requirement. This early example asks for an Acquaintance relationship with Sonia.</figcaption></figure></section>
<section id="en-beats-1-10"><h2>Beats 1–10</h2><details><summary>Show destinations and requirements for Beats 1–10</summary><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Beat</th><th scope="col">Exact destination</th><th scope="col">Arrival window</th><th scope="col">Additional requirements / preparation</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">1</th><td data-label="Exact destination">University Research Lab — Present, Uptown</td><td data-label="Arrival window">09:00–17:00</td><td data-label="Additional requirements / preparation">—</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">2</th><td data-label="Exact destination">City Beach — Present, Uptown</td><td data-label="Arrival window">08:00–18:00</td><td data-label="Additional requirements / preparation">—</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">3</th><td data-label="Exact destination">Nova’s Quantum Research Lab — Future, Fringe Zone</td><td data-label="Arrival window">00:00–23:00</td><td data-label="Additional requirements / preparation">—</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">4</th><td data-label="Exact destination">University Research Lab — Present, Uptown</td><td data-label="Arrival window">09:00–17:00</td><td data-label="Additional requirements / preparation">Sonia: Acquaintance+.</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">5</th><td data-label="Exact destination">City Beach — Present, Uptown</td><td data-label="Arrival window">08:00–18:00</td><td data-label="Additional requirements / preparation">—</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">6</th><td data-label="Exact destination">Back Alley — Present, Downtown</td><td data-label="Arrival window">22:00–00:00</td><td data-label="Additional requirements / preparation">Two successive fights; recover first.</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">7</th><td data-label="Exact destination">Police Station — Present, Downtown</td><td data-label="Arrival window">15:00–23:00</td><td data-label="Additional requirements / preparation">—</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">8</th><td data-label="Exact destination">Dojo — Present, Downtown</td><td data-label="Arrival window">10:00–22:00</td><td data-label="Additional requirements / preparation">Choose Ask Lilu to Train You.</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">9</th><td data-label="Exact destination">Hidden Waterfall — Present, Uptown</td><td data-label="Arrival window">07:00–11:00</td><td data-label="Additional requirements / preparation">Eight-hour training; recover before Beat 10.</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">10</th><td data-label="Exact destination">Back Alley — Present, Downtown</td><td data-label="Arrival window">22:00–00:00</td><td data-label="Additional requirements / preparation">Four successive fights; recover first.</td></tr></tbody></table></details></section>
<section id="en-beats-11-23"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Beats_11_to_23_—_Research_and_Travel"></span><h2>Beats 11–23</h2><details><summary>Show destinations and requirements for Beats 11–23</summary><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Beat</th><th scope="col">Exact destination</th><th scope="col">Arrival window</th><th scope="col">Additional requirements / preparation</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">11</th><td data-label="Exact destination">University Research Lab — Present, Uptown</td><td data-label="Arrival window">09:00–17:00</td><td data-label="Additional requirements / preparation">Choose Discuss the Research Findings.</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">12</th><td data-label="Exact destination">Police Station — Present, Downtown</td><td data-label="Arrival window">15:00–23:00</td><td data-label="Additional requirements / preparation">—</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">13</th><td data-label="Exact destination">Downtown Restaurant — Present, Downtown</td><td data-label="Arrival window">19:00–21:00</td><td data-label="Additional requirements / preparation">—</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">14</th><td data-label="Exact destination">Nova’s Quantum Research Lab — Future, Fringe Zone</td><td data-label="Arrival window">Any</td><td data-label="Additional requirements / preparation">—</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">15</th><td data-label="Exact destination">Resistance Hideout — Future, Fringe Zone</td><td data-label="Arrival window">13:00–23:00</td><td data-label="Additional requirements / preparation">—</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">16</th><td data-label="Exact destination">Surplus Distribution Center — Future, Fringe Zone</td><td data-label="Arrival window">12:00–18:00</td><td data-label="Additional requirements / preparation">—</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">17</th><td data-label="Exact destination">Ancient Earth Shrine — Medieval, Village Outskirts</td><td data-label="Arrival window">06:00–15:00</td><td data-label="Additional requirements / preparation">—</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">18</th><td data-label="Exact destination">Surplus Distribution Center — Future, Fringe Zone</td><td data-label="Arrival window">12:00–18:00</td><td data-label="Additional requirements / preparation">—</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">19</th><td data-label="Exact destination">Industrial Waste Processing Zone — Future, Fringe Zone</td><td data-label="Arrival window">08:00–18:00</td><td data-label="Additional requirements / preparation">Four successive fights; recover first.</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">20</th><td data-label="Exact destination">Underground Modification Clinic — Future, Prime Sector</td><td data-label="Arrival window">Any</td><td data-label="Additional requirements / preparation">—</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">21</th><td data-label="Exact destination">Nova’s Quantum Research Lab — Future, Fringe Zone</td><td data-label="Arrival window">Any</td><td data-label="Additional requirements / preparation">—</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">22</th><td data-label="Exact destination">Glitch’s Den — Future, Fringe Zone</td><td data-label="Arrival window">Any</td><td data-label="Additional requirements / preparation">Long scene; plan recovery afterward.</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">23</th><td data-label="Exact destination">Archive Facility — Future, Fringe Zone</td><td data-label="Arrival window">Any</td><td data-label="Additional requirements / preparation">Successfully Hack Archive Terminal.</td></tr></tbody></table></details></section>
