cope="row">31</th><td data-label="Exact destination">Resistance Hideout — Future, Fringe Zone</td><td data-label="Arrival window">Any</td><td data-label="Additional requirements / preparation">—</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">32</th><td data-label="Exact destination">Underground Modification Clinic — Future, Prime Sector</td><td data-label="Arrival window">Any</td><td data-label="Additional requirements / preparation">If Require TD for Story is ON: 10 Hideout waves cleared.</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">33</th><td data-label="Exact destination">Robot Bar — Future, Prime Sector</td><td data-label="Arrival window">18:00–00:00</td><td data-label="Additional requirements / preparation">Have $20,000 available; payment is consumed.</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">34</th><td data-label="Exact destination">Operations Center — Future, Resistance Fortress (via Cid’s clinic)</td><td data-label="Arrival window">Any</td><td data-label="Additional requirements / preparation">—</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">35</th><td data-label="Exact destination">AIMy’s Control — Future, Resistance Fortress</td><td data-label="Arrival window">Any</td><td data-label="Additional requirements / preparation">—</td></tr></tbody></table></details></section>
