ata-label="Additional requirements / preparation">—</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">43</th><td data-label="Exact destination">Arcane Room — Medieval, Rose &amp; Thorn</td><td data-label="Arrival window">Any</td><td data-label="Additional requirements / preparation">Bella and Blinky: Romantic+; finish Blinky’s Never Been Kissed H2H.</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">44</th><td data-label="Exact destination">Ancient Earth Shrine (Altar Chamber) — Medieval, Village Outskirts</td><td data-label="Arrival window">15:00–21:00</td><td data-label="Additional requirements / preparation">—</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">45</th><td data-label="Exact destination">Rose &amp; Thorn — Medieval, Kings Demesne</td><td data-label="Arrival window">08:00–18:00</td><td data-label="Additional requirements / preparation">—</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">46</th><td data-label="Exact destination">Sorceress Home — Medieval, Village Outskirts</td><td data-label="Arrival window">Any</td><td data-label="Additional requirements / preparation">—</td></tr></tbody></table></details></section>
