n</td><td data-label="Arrival window">07:00–17:00</td><td data-label="Additional requirements / preparation">Meet Christy’s Cousin Mary Ann complete.</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">54</th><td data-label="Exact destination">Miki’s Bedroom — Present, Downtown Mansion</td><td data-label="Arrival window">18:00–22:00</td><td data-label="Additional requirements / preparation">—</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">55</th><td data-label="Exact destination">Town Hall Office — Present, Uptown</td><td data-label="Arrival window">09:00–17:00</td><td data-label="Additional requirements / preparation">Have $10,000,000 available; payment is consumed.</td></tr></tbody></table></details></section>
