el="Additional requirements / preparation">Pixie, Lindia and Blinky not vacationing; prepare for a custom story battle.</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">82</th><td data-label="Exact destination">Rose &amp; Thorn — Medieval, Kings Demesne</td><td data-label="Arrival window">Any</td><td data-label="Additional requirements / preparation">Elara, Sophie, Valkyra, Lindia, Gem, Willow and Ember not vacationing.</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">83</th><td data-label="Exact destination">Rose &amp; Thorn — Medieval, Kings Demesne</td><td data-label="Arrival window">19:00–00:00 / 00:00–03:00</td><td data-label="Additional requirements / preparation">Elara, Valkyra, Ember, Willow, Gem, Blinky and Lindia not vacationing; prepare for a custom story battle.</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">84</th><td data-label="Exact destination">Rose &amp; Thorn — Medieval, Kings Demesne</td><td data-label="Arrival window">Any</td><td data-label="Additional requirements / preparation">—</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">85</th><td data-label="Exact destination">Ancient Earth Shrine (Altar Chamber) — Medieval, Village Outskirts</td><td data-label="Arrival window">15:00–21:00</td><td data-label="Additional requirements / preparation">—</td></tr></tbody></table></details></section>
<section id="en-beats-86-99"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Beats_1_to_10_.E2.80.94_Present_Era"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Beats_11_to_23_.E2.80.94_Research_and_Travel"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Beats_24_to_35_.E2.80.94_Resistance_Route"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Beats_36_to_46_.E2.80.94_Rose_and_Thorn_Route"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Beats_47_to_55_.E2.80.94_Present_Era_Follow-Up"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Beats_56_to_62_.E2.80.94_Required_Visits"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Beats_63_to_76_.E2.80.94_Further_Preparation"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Beats_77_to_85_.E2.80.94_Latest_Released_Route"></span><h2>Beats 86–99</h2><details><summary>Show destinations and requirements for Beats 86–99</summary><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Beat</th><th scope="col">Exact destination</th><th scope="col">Arrival window</th><th scope="col">Additional requirements / preparation</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">86</th><td data-label="Exact destination">University Research Lab — Present, Uptown</td><td data-label="Arrival window">09:00–17:00</td><td data-label="Additional requirements / preparation">Sonia’s A Result Worth Keeping and No Control Group H2H complete.</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">87</th><td data-label="Exact destination">Police Station — Present, Downtown</td><td data-label="Arrival window">20:00–23:00</td><td data-label="Additional requirements / preparation">Becky’s required personal-story finale complete; see late-route checklist.</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">88</th><td data-label="Exact destination">Boardroom — Present, Downtown Office</td><td data-label="Arrival window">09:00–15:00</td><td data-label="Additional requirements / preparation">Evangeline’s Controlling Interest complete.</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">89</th><td data-label="Exact destination">Mansion Foyer — Present, Downtown</td><td data-label="Arrival window">18:00–22:00</td><td data-label="Additional requirements / preparation">—</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">90</th><td data-label="Exact destination">Basement — Present, Downtown Mansion</td><td data-label="Arrival window">18:00–23:00</td><td data-label="Additional requirements / preparation">Prepare for a custom story battle.</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">91</th><td data-label="Exact destination">Basement — Present, Downtown Mansion</td><td data-label="Arrival window">Any</td><td data-label="Additional requirements / preparation">—</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">92</th><td data-label="Exact destination">Operations Center — Future, Resistance Fortress (via Cid’s clinic)</td><td data-label="Arrival window">Any</td><td data-label="Additional requirements / preparation">—</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">93</th><td data-label="Exact destination">Barracks — Future, Resistance Fortress</td><td data-label="Arrival window">Any</td><td data-label="Additional requirements / preparation">—</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">94</th><td data-label="Exact destination">AIMy’s Control — Future, Resistance Fortress</td><td data-label="Arrival window">Any</td><td data-label="Additional requirements / preparation">—</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">95</th><td data-label="Exact destination">Operations Center — Future, Resistance Fortress (via Cid’s clinic)</td><td data-label="Arrival window">Any</td><td data-label="Additional requirements / preparation">Kuro’s The Carrier Window complete.</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">96</th><td data-label="Exact destination">Operations Center — Future, Resistance Fortress (via Cid’s clinic)</td><td data-label="Arrival window">Any</td><td data-label="Additional requirements / preparation">—</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">97</th><td data-label="Exact destination">Operations Center — Future, Resistance Fortress (via Cid’s clinic)</td><td data-label="Arrival window">Any</td><td data-label="Additional requirements / preparation">AIMy’s With You complete; if TD is required, 30 Fortress Interior waves cleared.</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">98</th><td data-label="Exact destination">Operations Center — Future, Resistance Fortress (via Cid’s clinic)</td><td data-label="Arrival window">Any</td><td data-label="Additional requirements / preparation">—</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">99</th><td data-label="Exact destination">VOID Central Command Headquarters — Future, Prime Sector</td><td data-label="Arrival window">Any</td><td data-label="Additional requirements / preparation">Enter Central Command, rather than returning to Operations Center.</td></tr></tbody></table></details></section>
<section id="en-preparation"><h2>Payments, workers and availability</h2><details><summary>Show the recruitment and vacation checklist for Beats 79–83</summary><p>Before Beat 79, complete Sashina’s <strong>A Final Preparation</strong> action at the Altar Chamber (the plot is <strong>Sashina’s Gift</strong>). It appears after Beat 55, requires <strong>In Love</strong>, and has a base cost of <strong>180 minutes and 200 Energy</strong>. Pixie and Ember must also be active.</p><p>Beat 80 requires these <strong>12 worker entries</strong> active: <strong>Elara, Sophie, Sandra, Raven, Bellavia, Valkyra, Lindia, Ava and Eva, Gem, Pixie, Willow and Ember</strong>. Ava and Eva count as one worker entry. All twelve must also be off resort vacation. Beats 81–83 use the separate vacation lists in their rows; recruitment and current availability are different checks.</p></details><p>The cash gates consume <strong>$20,000 at Beat 33</strong> and <strong>$10,000,000 at Beat 55</strong>. Hold available Wealth, rather than uncollected business earnings or investment value. Beat 51 consumes <strong>one Flowers item</strong>. Relationship gates refer to stages, with higher stages accepted; merely meeting a required worker does not recruit them.</p></section>
<section id="en-td"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Tower_Defense_Story_Gates"></span><h2>Tower Defense requirements</h2><p>The Notebook’s <strong>Require TD for Story</strong> setting controls mandatory campaign-clear gates. With it ON, bank all cleared waves in the table below, then return to the listed story location. OFF bypasses these story gates; it does not grant a battle victory, rewards, recruits or Infinite Mode.</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Before</th><th scope="col">Required campaign clear</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">32</th><td data-label="Required campaign clear">Hideout: 10 waves</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">76</th><td data-label="Required campaign clear">Fortress: 20 waves</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">97</th><td data-label="Required campaign clear">Fortress Interior: 30 waves</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">100</th><td data-label="Required campaign clear">Fortress Interior: 30 waves; final campaign: 40 waves</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reached-wave numbers are not the same as fully cleared waves. Beat 76 also needs the Syndicate’s <a href="game-systems-chaos-syndicate.html">The Bug</a> and arrival at Operations Center at <strong>22:00–04:00</strong>. See <a href="game-systems-tower-defense.html">Tower Defense</a> for deployment, supplies and training.</p></section>
<section id="en-late-prerequisites"><h2>Later prerequisite checklist</h2><details><summary>Spoiler opt-in: show required personal-event labels for Beats 86–97</summary><p>This checklist names required personal events, without recounting their endings. Use the character’s current menu and Quest Log to work through earlier steps; the final event alone is not a shortcut past its prerequisites.</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Beat blocked</th><th scope="col">Required personal progression</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">86</th><td data-label="Required personal progression">Sonia: A Result Worth Keeping at the Research Lab, Crush+, 09:00–17:00, after A Forecast for Two. Then select No Control Group H2H, Crush+, 14:00–16:00, 60 minutes / 15 Energy; it also needs Stay Without a Reason completed.</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">87</th><td data-label="Required personal progression">Becky: finish Closing the Net, then the event named Kane Falls at the Back Alley, Crush+, 20:00–00:00. Return to the Police Station for Beat 87 at 20:00–23:00.</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">88</th><td data-label="Required personal progression">Finish Evangeline’s Controlling Interest at the Mansion Foyer, 20:00–23:00. It needs Private Valuation, Miki Demands Food, Katie and Miki’s mall scene, Evangeline’s Unpriced H2H, Miki’s Terms of Ownership / What Are You Building? / No Audience H2Hs, and Arnold’s Household Risk H2H. Then go to the Office Boardroom for Beat 88, 09:00–15:00.</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">95</th><td data-label="Required personal progression">After Beat 94, enter the Mood Center while Kuro is present, 10:00–22:00, for The Carrier Window. This does not require finishing Kuro’s entire romance route.</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">97</th><td data-label="Required personal progression">After Beat 96, complete AIMy’s With You from her Control Room portrait: In Love, Stay With Me complete, What I Want After H2H complete, and the 30-wave Fortress Interior check if TD is required. Base cost: 120 minutes / 30 Energy. What I Want After itself needs In Love, Stay With Me and Let Me Ask Properly H2H; 60 minutes / 20 Energy. Return to Operations Center afterward.</td></tr></tbody></table></details></section>
<section id="en-beat-100"><h2>Beat 100</h2><details><summary>Major late-route spoiler opt-in: show final destinations and relationship prerequisites</summary><p>After Beat 99, return to <strong>VOID Central Command</strong> for the final campaign. With TD required, clear <strong>all 40 waves</strong>; otherwise its story check is bypassed. Select <strong>The Way We Made</strong> from Central Command’s action menu, which opens the <strong>Enter VOID Master Control</strong> action. Beat 100 begins at Master Control only after the checklist below is complete.</p><p><strong>Reach In Love with VOID: 3,000 relationship points in the current game.</strong> The Relationships screen shows In Love without needing Data Mining; with Data Mining it shows In Love: MAX. There is no additional amount to grind above that stage. Complete the scenes and four H2Hs below as separate requirements, plus AIMy’s With You and the Fortress Interior story check.</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Scene / menu action</th><th scope="col">Requirements after Beat 99</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">After Your Victory</th><td data-label="Requirements after Beat 99">First Master Control visit</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">A Standing Ovation</th><td data-label="Requirements after Beat 99">Known+; After Your Victory</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Why You Keep Returning — H2H</th><td data-label="Requirements after Beat 99">Known+; A Standing Ovation</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Perfect World</th><td data-label="Requirements after Beat 99">Acquaintance+; A Standing Ovation; first H2H</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Everything That Remains</th><td data-label="Requirements after Beat 99">Friend+; The Perfect World</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Why Anything Matters — H2H</th><td data-label="Requirements after Beat 99">Close Friend+; Everything That Remains; first H2H</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">An Error She Keeps</th><td data-label="Requirements after Beat 99">Close Friend+; Everything That Remains; second H2H</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Unsolved Variable — H2H</th><td data-label="Requirements after Beat 99">Crush+; An Error She Keeps; second H2H</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Storm She Didn’t Stop</th><td data-label="Requirements after Beat 99">Romantic+; An Error She Keeps; third H2H</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Between Two Skies</th><td data-label="Requirements after Beat 99">Intimate+; The Storm She Didn’t Stop; third H2H</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Distance She Chooses — H2H</th><td data-label="Requirements after Beat 99">Intimate+; Between Two Skies; third H2H</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Here With You</th><td data-label="Requirements after Beat 99">In Love; Between Two Skies; fourth H2H</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Missing Last Note</th><td data-label="Requirements after Beat 99">Friend+; Everything That Remains</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">A World That Runs</th><td data-label="Requirements after Beat 99">Close Friend+; An Error She Keeps; second H2H</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">No Timetable for Two</th><td data-label="Requirements after Beat 99">Romantic+; The Storm She Didn’t Stop; third H2H</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Dragon’s Terms</th><td data-label="Requirements after Beat 99">Romantic+; No Timetable for Two; third H2H</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Where the Whales Dance</th><td data-label="Requirements after Beat 99">Intimate+; The Dragon’s Terms; third H2H</td></tr></tbody></table><p>All rows take place at Master Control. Re-enter for automatic scenes; choose the four H2Hs from the portrait menu. Each H2H has a base cost of <strong>60 minutes and 20 Energy</strong>. Between Two Skies, No Timetable for Two, The Dragon’s Terms and Where the Whales Dance are manually selected portrait date actions: each costs a base <strong>120 minutes / 25 Energy</strong>, with no money payment. Entering the room alone does not start them. The three side branches (The Missing Last Note; A World That Runs; No Timetable for Two → The Dragon’s Terms → Where the Whales Dance) are required for Beat 100 too. Re-enter Master Control once everything is complete.</p></details></section>
<section id="en-recovery"><h2>Prepare resources before the next visit</h2><p>Save, equip your weapon, armor and grimoire, and restore Health, Energy, Calm and Satiation before combat visits. Beats 6, 10 and 19 contain two, four and four successive fights. Later custom encounters have their own instructions and transitions; follow their telegraphs and continue through the scene. The main-story trigger does not impose a general minimum combat stat where none is listed.</p><p>Beat 8’s manual action takes 60 minutes and leaves Health 20, Energy 1, Calm 1. Beat 9 advances eight hours, gives +5 Strength/Stamina/Ability, and leaves the same low resources. Beat 22 advances 18 hours and leaves Energy, Calm and Satiation at 10. Many other scenes also move the clock: missing the next narrow appointment after a long scene is normal. Recovery and returning the next day are valid preparation.</p><p>See <a href="game-systems-combat-system.html">Combat System</a> for battle controls and <a href="game-systems-alignment-system.html">Alignment</a> for mapped dialogue-choice points. Not every Caring, Funny or Flirty response changes alignment, and replaying scenes through EXTRAS does not advance the live main story.</p></section>
<section id="en-after-100"><h2>After Beat 100</h2><p>Beat 100 completes the numbered main story. Check Objectives and Communications for remaining side content rather than searching for Beat 101. Personal routes, businesses, dungeons and other activities can still have their own goals.</p><details><summary>Spoiler opt-in: show the 19 post-story follow-up destinations</summary><p>These are one-time visits after Beat 100, not additional numbered beats. Existing location access still applies. Where multiple scenes are pending, finish one and re-enter.</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Destination</th><th scope="col">Arrival window</th><th scope="col">Extra order</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Operations Center — Future, Resistance Fortress (via Cid’s clinic)</th><td data-label="Arrival window">Any</td><td data-label="Extra order">—</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Archive Facility — Future, Fringe Zone</th><td data-label="Arrival window">Any</td><td data-label="Extra order">—</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Mood Center — Future, Prime Sector</th><td data-label="Arrival window">10:00–22:00</td><td data-label="Extra order">—</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Glitch’s Den — Future, Fringe Zone</th><td data-label="Arrival window">Any</td><td data-label="Extra order">—</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Bar — Medieval, Rose &amp; Thorn</th><td data-label="Arrival window">Any</td><td data-label="Extra order">—</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Robot Bar — Future, Prime Sector</th><td data-label="Arrival window">Any</td><td data-label="Extra order">—</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Performance Stage — Medieval</th><td data-label="Arrival window">12:00–18:00</td><td data-label="Extra order">—</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">City Library — Present, Uptown</th><td data-label="Arrival window">08:00–18:00</td><td data-label="Extra order">—</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">City Beach — Present, Uptown</th><td data-label="Arrival window">09:00–17:00</td><td data-label="Extra order">—</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Throne Room — Medieval</th><td data-label="Arrival window">10:00–17:00</td><td data-label="Extra order">—</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Farmers Market — Present, Uptown</th><td data-label="Arrival window">07:00–17:00</td><td data-label="Extra order">—</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Mansion Foyer — Present, Downtown</th><td data-label="Arrival window">18:00–00:00</td><td data-label="Extra order">—</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">University Research Lab — Present, Uptown</th><td data-label="Arrival window">Any</td><td data-label="Extra order">—</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Rose &amp; Thorn — Medieval, Kings Demesne</th><td data-label="Arrival window">Any</td><td data-label="Extra order">—</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Ancient Earth Shrine (Altar Chamber) — Medieval, Village Outskirts</th><td data-label="Arrival window">Any</td><td data-label="Extra order">Complete the Operations Center follow-up first.</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Seraph’s Sanctuary — Future</th><td data-label="Arrival window">Any</td><td data-label="Extra order">—</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Lillian’s Lair — Medieval</th><td data-label="Arrival window">Any</td><td data-label="Extra order">—</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Den — Future, Syndicate</th><td data-label="Arrival window">Any</td><td data-label="Extra order">—</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Bandit Hideout — Medieval</th><td data-label="Arrival window">Any</td><td data-label="Extra order">Complete the Operations Center follow-up first.</td></tr></tbody></table></details></section>
<section id="en-troubleshooting"><h2>When nothing happens</h2><p>Check the current beat in Objectives/Communications, then confirm the previous scene finished, the exact room, the arrival window, and every extra condition in your row. Re-enter after a different automatic plot finishes. Check worker activation and vacations separately. For a personal route, a portrait action, an H2H and an automatic location scene are distinct steps. An edition/access notice is a separate gate; repeating a visit does not remove it.</p><p>The toughest later stops usually come from an unfinished personal event or a campaign record, not from missing a hidden general stat requirement. For Beat 100, use its opt-in checklist and the In Love stage indicator rather than guessing at an extra “MAX” total.</p></section>
<section id="en-related"><h2>Related guides</h2><ul><li><a href="getting-started.html">Getting Started</a></li><li><a href="locations.html">Locations and travel</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-chaos-syndicate.html">Syndicate missions and alliance</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-tower-defense.html">Tower Defense</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-brothel.html">Rose &amp; Thorn management</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-dungeon.html">Ordinary dungeon</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-combat-system.html">Combat System</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-alignment-system.html">Alignment</a></li></ul><p>Verified for v1.0 Beta x · Updated 8 November 2026. Community route inspiration: Sh1n7.</p></section>
</div><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-zh" data-lang-panel="zh" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><div class="starter-lead"><p>先查看<strong>当前目标、通信和行动选单</strong>。本页按完整发行版<strong>v1.0_BETAx主线第1–100段</strong>整理推进路线。只展开自己正在游玩的段落即可：表格会列出地点和前置条件，不讲述身份秘密、角色命运或场景结局。</p></div>
<section id="zh-follow"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-How_to_Follow_the_Story"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Reading_Time_Windows"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Major_Gates_to_Prepare_For"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Beats_1_to_10_—_Present_Era"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Late-Route_Recruitment_and_Availability"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Combat_Preparation_Without_Story_Outcomes"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Alignment_and_Scene_Choices"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Time_Costs_and_Recovery"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Troubleshooting"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-The_Next_Beat_Does_Not_Trigger"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Common_Stops"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Accuracy_and_Related_Guides"></span><h2>找到下一步</h2><p>主线按编号依次推进。除表格另有说明外，触发条件就是：完成上一段、能够进入指定房间，并在规定时段到达。建筑外侧、区域地图和相邻房间不能代替目标地点。请把对话和选项走完；检查下一场自动剧情时，离开后重新进入。</p><p><strong>第8和第11段需要手动选择行动。</strong>在道场选择「请 Lilu 来训练你」，在研究实验室选择「讨论研究结果」。单纯进入房间不会开始这两段。个人剧情中的谈心也需要从对应角色的头像选单选择；相似名称的自动剧情不能替代谈心。</p><p>时间以游戏内时钟为准，包含起始时刻、不包含结束时刻：09:00–17:00表示09:00至16:59。跨午夜的时段按两段列出。「不限时段」只表示剧情没有额外时间限制，地点自身的开放时间和进入条件仍然有效。图书馆通常在08:00–22:00开放。</p><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 900px"><a aria-label="查看完整截图：通信顶部显示当前主线编号与下一步条件。这个前期示例要求与 Sonia 达到「相识」。" href="../assets/images/wiki/story-guide/zh-current-objective-full.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="通信顶部显示当前主线编号与下一步条件。这个前期示例要求与 Sonia 达到「相识」。" decoding="async" height="102" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/story-guide/zh-current-objective.webp" width="702"/></a><figcaption>通信顶部显示当前主线编号与下一步条件。这个前期示例要求与 Sonia 达到「相识」。</figcaption></figure></section>
<section id="zh-beats-1-10"><h2>第1–10段</h2><details><summary>展开第1–10段的地点与条件</summary><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">段落</th><th scope="col">准确地点</th><th scope="col">到达时段</th><th scope="col">额外条件／准备</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">1</th><td data-label="准确地点">大学研究实验室 · 现代／上城区</td><td data-label="到达时段">09:00–17:00</td><td data-label="额外条件／准备">—</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">2</th><td data-label="准确地点">城市海滩（上城区） · 现代／上城区</td><td data-label="到达时段">08:00–18:00</td><td data-label="额外条件／准备">—</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">3</th><td data-label="准确地点">Nova的量子研究实验室 · 未来／边缘区</td><td data-label="到达时段">00:00–23:00</td><td data-label="额外条件／准备">—</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">4</th><td data-label="准确地点">大学研究实验室 · 现代／上城区</td><td data-label="到达时段">09:00–17:00</td><td data-label="额外条件／准备">Sonia达到「相识」或更高阶段。</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">5</th><td data-label="准确地点">城市海滩（上城区） · 现代／上城区</td><td data-label="到达时段">08:00–18:00</td><td data-label="额外条件／准备">—</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">6</th><td data-label="准确地点">后巷 · 现代／市中心</td><td data-label="到达时段">22:00–00:00</td><td data-label="额外条件／准备">连续两场战斗；先恢复资源。</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">7</th><td data-label="准确地点">警察局 · 现代／市中心</td><td data-label="到达时段">15:00–23:00</td><td data-label="额外条件／准备">—</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">8</th><td data-label="准确地点">道场 · 现代／市中心</td><td data-label="到达时段">10:00–22:00</td><td data-label="额外条件／准备">手动选择「请 Lilu 来训练你」。</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">9</th><td data-label="准确地点">隐藏瀑布 · 现代／上城区</td><td data-label="到达时段">07:00–11:00</td><td data-label="额外条件／准备">训练会推进8小时；进入第10段前先恢复。</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">10</th><td data-label="准确地点">后巷 · 现代／市中心</td><td data-label="到达时段">22:00–00:00</td><td data-label="额外条件／准备">连续四场战斗；先恢复资源。</td></tr></tbody></table></details></section>
<section id="zh-beats-11-23"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Beats_11_to_23_—_Research_and_Travel"></span><h2>第11–23段</h2><details><summary>展开第11–23段的地点与条件</summary><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">段落</th><th scope="col">准确地点</th><th scope="col">到达时段</th><th scope="col">额外条件／准备</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">11</th><td data-label="准确地点">大学研究实验室 · 现代／上城区</td><td data-label="到达时段">09:00–17:00</td><td data-label="额外条件／准备">手动选择「讨论研究结果」。</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">12</th><td data-label="准确地点">警察局 · 现代／市中心</td><td data-label="到达时段">15:00–23:00</td><td data-label="额外条件／准备">—</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">13</th><td data-label="准确地点">市中心餐厅 · 现代／市中心</td><td data-label="到达时段">19:00–21:00</td><td data-label="额外条件／准备">—</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">14</th><td data-label="准确地点">Nova的量子研究实验室 · 未来／边缘区</td><td data-label="到达时段">不限时段</td><td data-label="额外条件／准备">—</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">15</th><td data-label="准确地点">反抗军藏身处 · 未来／边缘区</td><td data-label="到达时段">13:00–23:00</td><td data-label="额外条件／准备">—</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">16</th><td data-label="准确地点">剩余物资分配中心 · 未来／边缘区</td><td data-label="到达时段">12:00–18:00</td><td data-label="额外条件／准备">—</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">17</th><td data-label="准确地点">远古大地神殿 · 中世纪／村庄郊外</td><td data-label="到达时段">06:00–15:00</td><td data-label="额外条件／准备">—</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">18</th><td data-label="准确地点">剩余物资分配中心 · 未来／边缘区</td><td data-label="到达时段">12:00–18:00</td><td data-label="额外条件／准备">—</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">19</th><td data-label="准确地点">工业废料处理区 · 未来／边缘区</td><td data-label="到达时段">08:00–18:00</td><td data-label="额外条件／准备">连续四场战斗；先恢复资源。</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">20</th><td data-label="准确地点">地下改造诊所 · 未来／核心区</td><td data-label="到达时段">不限时段</td><td data-label="额外条件／准备">—</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">21</th><td data-label="准确地点">Nova的量子研究实验室 · 未来／边缘区</td><td data-label="到达时段">不限时段</td><td data-label="额外条件／准备">—</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">22</th><td data-label="准确地点">Glitch的藏身处 · 未来／边缘区</td><td data-label="到达时段">不限时段</td><td data-label="额外条件／准备">场景耗时较长，结束后注意恢复。</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">23</th><td data-label="准确地点">档案设施 · 未来／边缘区</td><td data-label="到达时段">不限时段</td><td data-label="额外条件／准备">成功完成「入侵档案终端」。</td></tr></tbody></table></details></section>
